ointing to an error message element id (e.g.,\n\"card-cvc-error\") that you render when there is an error; apply the same pattern\nto CardNumber and CardExpiryDate components referencing their own ids and error\nmessage ids.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:f16fc9fe-e5be-43d5-9abe-7a6058f7692e -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
